  "transforms": [
    "Original SWF vector/sprite/animation exports via FFDec; ActionScript not executed.",
    "Removed non-rendered authoring guides from igloo; expanded avatar render bounds.",
    "Original penguin body recolored for six player-selected colors; original faces, shading and animation retained.",
    "Original interface artwork composed on its original round button.",
    "Original numbered music clips decoded and concatenated in numeric order, encoded to local 128kbps MP3."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Decorating offers eight items and four source orientations, rather than the full original catalog.",
    "Only the opening twelve subframes of each selected animation are retained; movement and additional reactions are authored in Canvas.",
    "HTML dialogs and procedural interaction cues are reconstructed. The room, characters, furniture and interface icons use original archived artwork. The original period wordmark is recorded separately in logo-provenance.json.",
    "Archive access is not an open license to Disney artwork. Retain the in-app attribution; no claim of public-domain artwork."
  ],
